---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Global Horizon Standard">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 py-20 font-sans text-[#5e554a] leading-[24px]">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[32px] leading-[1.15] text-[#1f1b16] mb-10">Privacy policy</h1>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7b7266] mb-3">I. Data protection at a glance</h2>
      <p>
        We take the protection of your personal data very seriously. This website is designed to be
        minimal and privacy-preserving. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics services, or
        social media plugins.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7b7266] mb-3">II. Hosting and server log files</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted by <span class="text-[#1f1b16] font-medium">Vercel</span> (Vercel
        Inc., 340 S Lemon Ave #4133, Walnut, CA 91789, USA). When you access our website, Vercel
        automatically collects information that your browser sends. This includes your IP address,
        browser type, operating system, and the time of access.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        This data is used solely to ensure the security and stability of the platform. Vercel is
        GDPR compliant through its Data Processing Addendum.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7b7266] mb-3">III. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        As a user, you have the right to request information about the data stored about you at any
        time. You also have the right to request the correction, blocking, or deletion of this data.
        If you have any questions, please contact the address provided in the Imprint.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#1f1b16]/8 text-xs text-[#7b7266]">
      Status: April 2026 — Global Horizon Standard Project
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
